               10  WE-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01760000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01770001
               10  WE-Contract-Type      Pic  X(03).                    01780000
               10  WE-From-Contr-No      Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01790000
               10  WE-To-Contr-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01800000
