      *                                                                 01900000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01910000
      * Storage, and switches for identifying the content:              01920000
      * The cursor info is used to verify that the get-next has the     01930000
      * same qualification as the get-1st.                              01940000
      *                                                                 01950000
       01  W-Storage.                                                   01960000
      *                                                                 01970000
           05  WS-Cursor-Info.                                          01980000
             07  WS-Key.                                                01990000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.02000000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    02010001
               10  WS-Contract-Type      Pic  X(03).                    02020000
               10  WS-From-Contr-No      Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.02030000
               10  WS-To-Contr-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.02040000
               10  WS-CA-Currency        Pic  X(03).                    02050000
               10  WS-From-PA-Seq-No     Pic S9(04)              Comp.  02060001
               10  WS-To-PA-Seq-No       Pic S9(04)              Comp.  02070001
               10  WS-Role-Type          Pic  X(10).                    02080001
             07  WS-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    02110000
               88  WS-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          02120000
               88  WS-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          02130000
             07  WS-Cursor-Status        Pic  X(08).                    02140000
               88  WS-Cursor-OK                     Value 'OK'.         02150000
               88  WS-Cursor-End                    Value 'END'.        02160000
      *                                                                 02170000
      * We store all occurences that are read, also those that we do    02180000
      * not find. This is to reduce the number of DB2 accesses.         02190000
      *                                                                 02200000
           05  WS-DB2-Table.                                            02210000
             07  WS-DB2-Row              Occurs 10 Times.               02220000
               10  WS-DB2-Tbl-Version    Pic  X(16).                    02230001
               10  WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.02240000
               10  WS-DB2-Contract-Type  Pic  X(03).                    02250000
               10  WS-DB2-Contract-No    Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.02260000
               10  WS-DB2-CA-Currency    Pic  X(03).                    02270000
               10  WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No      Pic S9(04)              Comp.  02280000
               10  WS-DB2-Role-Type      Pic  X(10).                    02290001
               10  WS-DB2-Row-Status     Pic S9(01)              Comp-3.02300001
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Read                Value +0.           02310000
                 88  WS-DB2-Read                    Value +1.           02320000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Found               Value +2.           02330000
               10  WS-DB2-DCL            Pic  X(250).                   02340000
