             When R115ITP0-In-Rel-MC                                    11560001
               Continue                                                 11570001
                                                                        11580001
             When R115ITP0-CA-Currency   Not = Space                    11590001
               Continue                                                 11600001
                                                                        11610001
             When R115ITP0-In-CA-Currency                               11620001
                                         Not = Space                    11630001
               Move R115ITP0-In-CA-Currency                             11640001
                                         To    R115ITP0-CA-Currency     11650001
                                                                        11660001
             When other                                                 11670001
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    11680001
               Move  'TF-PART-AMOUNT-MISSING'                           11690001
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  11700001
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               11710001
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              11720001
                                         To    True                     11730001
                                                                        11740001
           End-Evaluate                                                 11750001
      *                                                                 11760001
