           .                                                            12690000
      *################################################################.12700000
       J100-Move-DCL-To-Output           Section.                       12710000
      *                                                                 12720000
      * PLEASE REMEMBER:                                                12730001
      *    When you modify the code in this section, you need to do     12740001
      *    the same modifications in module F115ATP0 - E500-section.    12750004
      *                                                                 12760001
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    R115ITP0-Fin-Inst-ID     12770000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-Type      To    R115ITP0-Contract-Type   12780000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No        To    R115ITP0-Contract-No     12790000
      *                                                                 12800000
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            12810000
           Perform N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No                               12820000
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No           To    R115ITP0-Fin-Inst-No     12830000
      *                                                                 12840000
           Move  FK-KFTY-Role-Type       To    R115ITP0-Role-Type       12850003
      *                                                                 12860001
           Move  FK-TFCA-Currency        To    R115ITP0-CA-Currency     12870001
           Move  FK-TFPA-Seq-No          To    R115ITP0-PA-Seq-No       12880001
      *                                                                 13030001
           Move  TFTP-Bic                To    R115ITP0-Bic             13040004
           Move  TFTP-Navn               To    R115ITP0-Name            13050004
           Move  TFTP-Adresse-1          To    R115ITP0-Address1        13051005
           Move  TFTP-Adresse-2          To    R115ITP0-Address2        13052005
           Move  TFTP-Adresse-3          To    R115ITP0-Address3        13053005
           Move  TFTP-Adresse-4          To    R115ITP0-Address4        13054005
           Move  TFTP-Landkode           To    R115ITP0-Country-Code    13055004
           Move  TFTP-Geokode            To    R115ITP0-Geo-Code        13056004
      *                                                                 13060001
      * Info about the cursor:                                          13070000
      *                                                                 13080000
           Move  WC-Row-No               To    R115ITP0-Out-Row-No      13090001
           Move  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows     To    R115ITP0-Out-Total-Rows  13100001
      *                                                                 13110000
           .                                                            13120000
      *################################################################.13130000
       L100-Store-DCL                    Section.                       13140000
      *                                                                 13150000
      * We might already have this row in storage.                      13160001
      *                                                                 13170001
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        13180001
      *                                                                 13190001
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         13200001
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 13210001
             Then                                                       13220001
      *        If we have reached the end of the storage-table,         13230001
      *        we start on the beginning.                               13240001
      *        This way, we always keep the "newest" occurrences.       13250001
               Add   +1                  To    Ind-WS-Put               13260001
               If  Ind-WS-Put            >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         13270001
                   Move  +1              To    Ind-WS-Put               13280001
               End-If                                                   13290001
               Move  Ind-WS-Put          To    Ind-WS                   13300001
             Else                                                       13310001
               Move  Ind-WS              To    Ind-WS-Put               13320001
           End-If                                                       13330001
      *                                                                 13340001
      * We store the identification.                                    13350000
      *                                                                 13360000
           Move  R115ITP0-In-Table-Version                              13370001
                                         To    WS-DB2-Tbl-Version       13380001
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)13390001
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID       13400000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)13410000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-Type      To    WS-DB2-Contract-Type     13420000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)13430000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No        To    WS-DB2-Contract-No       13440000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)13450000
           Move  FK-TFCA-Currency        To    WS-DB2-CA-Currency       13460001
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)13470000
           Move  FK-TFPA-Seq-No          To    WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No         13480001
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)13490001
           Move  FK-KFTY-Role-Type       To    WS-DB2-Role-Type         13500003
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)13510001
      *                                                                 13520000
      * The DCL is stored if found, the status is set.                  13530000
      *                                                                 13540000
           Evaluate True                                                13550000
             When Length                 Of    DCLTF-Tast-Part          13560000
                > Length                 Of    WS-DB2-DCL               13570000
               Move  Length              Of    DCLTF-Tast-Part          13580000
                                         To    WD-Length                13590000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    13600000
               Move  'GL-WL-DCL-UTVIDES' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  13610000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)13620000
               Move  WD-Length           To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)13630000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               13640000
               Move  'L101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       13650000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       13660000
      *                                                                 13670000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 13680000
               Set   WS-DB2-Not-Found (Ind-WS-Put)                      13690000
                                         To    True                     13700000
      *                                                                 13710000
             When other                                                 13720000
               Move  DCLTF-Tast-Part                                    13730000
                                         To    WS-DB2-DCL   (Ind-WS-Put)13740000
               Set   WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS-Put)                           13750000
                                         To    True                     13760000
      *                                                                 13770000
           End-Evaluate                                                 13780000
      *                                                                 13790000
           .                                                            13800000
      *################################################################.13810000
       L200-Find-DCL                     Section.                       13820000
      *                                                                 13830000
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       13840000
                   From  +1              By    +1                       13850000
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         13860000
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Tbl-Version (Ind-WS)                    13870001
                                         =     R115ITP0-In-Table-Version13880001
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    13890001
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       13900000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-Type (Ind-WS)                  13910000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       13920000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-No (Ind-WS)                    13930000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-No         13940000
                     and WS-DB2-CA-Currency (Ind-WS)                    13950001
                                         =     FK-TFCA-Currency         13960001
                     and WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No (Ind-WS)                      13970001
                                         =     FK-TFPA-Seq-No           13980001
                     and WS-DB2-Role-Type (Ind-WS)                      13990001
                                         =     FK-KFTY-Role-Type )      14000003
           End-Perform                                                  14010000
      *                                                                 14020000
           .                                                            14030000
      *################################################################*14040000
       L300-Remove-DCL                   Section.                       14050000
      *                                                                 14060000
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       14070000
                   From  +1              By    +1                       14080000
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         14090000
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Tbl-Version (Ind-WS)                    14100001
                                         =     R115ITP0-In-Table-Version14110001
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    14120001
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       14130000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-Type (Ind-WS)                  14140000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       14150000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-No (Ind-WS)                    14160000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-No         14170000
                     and WS-DB2-CA-Currency (Ind-WS)                    14180001
                                         =     FK-TFCA-Currency         14190001
                     and WS-DB2-PA-Seq-No (Ind-WS)                      14200001
                                         =     FK-TFPA-Seq-No           14210001
                     and WS-DB2-Role-Type (Ind-WS)                      14220001
                                         =     FK-KFTY-Role-Type )      14230003
           End-Perform                                                  14240000
      *                                                                 14250000
           Evaluate True                                                14260000
             When Ind-WS                 >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         14270000
               Continue                                                 14280000
      *                                                                 14290000
             When other                                                 14300000
               Initialize                      WS-DB2-Row (Ind-WS)      14310000
      *                                                                 14320000
           End-Evaluate                                                 14330000
      *                                                                 14340000
           .                                                            14350000
      *################################################################*14360000
       N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID            Section.                       14370000
      *                                                                 14380000
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No (1:4)     To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         14390001
      *                                                                 14400001
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     14410000
           or  R5879010-In-Konsernnr     Not = W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         14420001
      *                                                                 14430000
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         14440000
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     14450000
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     14460000
               Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr    To    R5879010-In-Konsernnr    14470001
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         14480000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      14490000
               End-Call                                                 14500000
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               14510000
                   Move  'N101'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       14520000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   14530000
               End-If                                                   14540000
      *                                                                 14550000
           End-If                                                       14560000
      *                                                                 14570000
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsern-Id                              14580000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            14590000
      *                                                                 14600000
           .                                                            14610000
      *################################################################*14620000
       N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No            Section.                       14630000
      *                                                                 14640000
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     14650000
           or  R5879010-In-Konsern-ID    Not = W-Fin-Inst-ID            14660000
      *                                                                 14670000
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         14680000
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     14690000
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     14700000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R5879010-In-Konsern-ID   14710000
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         14720000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      14730000
               End-Call                                                 14740000
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               14750000
                   Move  'N201'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       14760000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   14770000
               End-If                                                   14780000
      *                                                                 14790000
           End-If                                                       14800000
      *                                                                 14810000
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsernnummer                           14820000
                                         To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         14830001
           Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr        To    W-Fin-Inst-No            14840001
      *                                                                 14850000
           .                                                            14860000
      *################################################################*14870000
       ZI00-Conv-Input-Version           Section.                       14880001
      *                                                                 14890000
      * Version control.                                                14900000
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         14910000
      *                                                                 14920000
           Set   R115ITP0-Version        To    True                     14930000
           Move  Length                  Of    R115ITP0-Tast-Part       14940000
                                         To    W-IO-Length              14950000
      *                                                                 14960000
           Evaluate True                                                14970000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115ITP0-Version-No      14980000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            14990000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              15000000
               Move  L-Ext-IO-Area (1:W-IO-Length)                      15010000
                                         To    W-Int-IO-Area            15020000
      *                                                                 15030000
             When Other                                                 15040000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         15050000
                   Using By Content      'F115ITP0 '                    15060000
                                         'INPUT '                       15070000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  15080000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  15090000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            15100000
               End-Call                                                 15110000
      *                                                                 15120000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                15130000
                   Move  'ZI03'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       15140000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   15150000
               End-If                                                   15160000
      *                                                                 15170000
           End-Evaluate                                                 15180000
      *                                                                 15190000
           .                                                            15200000
      *################################################################*15210000
       ZO00-Conv-Output-Version          Section.                       15220001
      *                                                                 15230000
      * Version control.                                                15240000
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         15250000
      *                                                                 15260000
           Evaluate True                                                15270000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115ITP0-Version-No      15280000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            15290000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              15300000
               Move  W-Int-IO-Area       To    L-Ext-IO-Area            15310000
                                                         (1:W-IO-Length)15320000
      *                                                                 15330000
             When Other                                                 15340000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         15350000
                   Using By Content      'F115ITP0 '                    15360000
                                         'OUTPUT '                      15370000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  15380000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  15390000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            15400000
               End-Call                                                 15410000
      *                                                                 15420000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                15430000
                   Move  'ZO01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       15440000
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   15450000
               End-If                                                   15460000
      *                                                                 15470000
           End-Evaluate                                                 15480000
      *                                                                 15490000
           .                                                            15500000
      *################################################################*15510000
       Z000-Error-Message                Section.                       15520000
      *                                                                 15530000
           Set   R7918030-Version        To    True                     15540000
      *                                                                 15550000
           Move  'TF'                    To    R7918030-In-System-ID    15560000
           Move  R115X000-Fin-Inst-No    To    R7918030-In-Fin-Inst-No  15570000
           Move  R115X000-FI-Language-639-1                             15580000
                                         To    R7918030-In-Language     15590000
           If  R115X000-Trace-On                                        15600001
               Set   R7918030-In-Log-Yes To    True                     15610001
           End-If                                                       15620001
      *                                                                 15630000
           Call  'F7918030'              Using R7918030-ErrorMessage    15640000
           End-Call                                                     15650000
      *                                                                 15660000
           Move  R7918030-Out-MessageText                               15670000
                                         To    R7919999-Message         15680000
      *                                                                 15690000
           .                                                            15700000
      *################################################################*15710000
       Z900-Abend                        Section.                       15720000
      *                                                                 15730000
           If  R7919999-Return-Code      Not   Numeric                  15740000
           or  Not R7919999-Return-Abend                                15750000
               Move  +0                  To    R7919999-Module-Ind      15760000
           End-If                                                       15770000
      *                                                                 15780000
           Add   +1                      To    R7919999-Module-Ind      15790000
      *                                                                 15800000
           If  R7919999-Module-Ind       Not >                          15810000
                             ( Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Tab      15820000
                             / Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Element )15830000
